      "fr_FR": "PROPRE EQUIPE"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastleScene_Text_OpponentOption",
      "en_US": "OPPONENT",
      "fr_FR": "EQUIPE ADVERSE"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastleScene_Text_BattleOption",
      "en_US": "BATTLE",
      "fr_FR": "COMBATTRE"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastleScene_Text_PassOption",
      "en_US": "PASS",
      "fr_FR": "PASSER UN TOUR"
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastleScene_Text_CastleValetApproaching",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, congratulations!\r",
        "You are to be commended on your\n",
        "mastery for keeping the streak alive.\r",
        "Our owner, recognizing your worth,\n",
        "demands you battle the Castle Valet.\r",
        "You are prepared, yes?\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Parsley: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, je vous\n",
        "félicite!\r",
        "Vous volez de victoire en victoire et\n",
        "vos exploits inspirent le respect.\r",
        "Dame Percila est impressionnée et\n",
        "souhaiterait vous voir affronter\f",
        "son Chambellan.\r",
        "J’ose espérer que vous relèverez\n",
        "le défi.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastleScene_Text_DarachIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: Welcome.\r",
        "I am Darach, as you know, and I am\n",
        "the Castle Valet.\r",
        "Lady Caitlin, my employer, is not one\n",
        "to accept defeat willingly.\r",
        "However, for a reason I’m not at\n",
        "liberty to disclose, she cannot battle.\r",
        "Consequently, I will do battle in her\n",
        "ladyship’s place.\r",
        "...Let me assure you that you won’t be\n",
        "shortchanged by facing me.\r",
        "En garde!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Parsley: Bienvenue.\r",
        "Comme vous le savez, mon nom est\n",
        "Parsley. Je suis le Chambellan du\f",
        "Castel de Combat.\r",
        "Pour une raison que je ne puis révéler,\n",
        "Dame Percila ne peut vous affronter\f",
        "en personne.\r",
        "De ce fait, c’est moi, Parsley, qui \n",
        "combattrai en son nom.\r",
        "En tant que représentant de Dame\n",
        "Percila, je ne saurais accepter\f",
        "la défaite.\r",
        "N’allez pas croire que je suis un\n",
        "adversaire facile. En garde!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastleScene_Text_DarachIntroGold",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: Your mastery of Pokémon is as\n",
        "breathtaking as ever.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you certainly are to be\n",
        "commended.\r",
        "...However, if I may say so, I noticed\n",
        "something about the way you battle.\r",
        "After all, I have had the opportunity\n",
        "to watch you closely firsthand.\r",
        "So, what is it that I noticed?\r",
        "As a Trainer myself, it is but proper\n",
        "etiquette to show you in a battle.\r",
        "Let us begin!\n",
        "En garde!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Parsley: Votre maîtrise des Pokémon\n",
        "est très impressionnante.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, vous avez toute mon\n",
        "admiration.\r",
        "Cependant, sauf votre respect, votre\n",
        "stratégie n’est pas sans faille.\r",
        "Après tout, j’ai eu maintes occasions\n",
        "de vous observer au combat.\r",
        "Vous souhaitez savoir où le bât blesse?\r",
        "En tant que Dresseur, il est de mon\n",
        "devoir de vous le montrer au combat.\r",
        "En garde!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastleScene_Text_BeatDarach",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, you are truly in\n",
        "possession of a superlative talent!\r",
        "I drew on every reserve of experience\n",
        "and etiquette handed down through\f",
        "our heritage of glorious servitude.\r",
        "But even then, I failed to fend off your\n",
        "inspired and inspiring challenge.\r",
        "I shall see to appeasing Lady Caitlin’s\n",
        "displeasure at my loss.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, please do return to our\n",
        "Battle Castle.\r",
        "We will be delighted and honored to have\n",
        "you back!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Parsley: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, votre style est\n",
        "tout simplement magistral!\r",
        "Ni mes observations passées ni ma\n",
        "longue expérience de Dresseur ne m’ont\f",
        "permis de vous faire obstacle.\r",
        "Votre manière de combattre est une\n",
        "véritable source d’inspiration.\r",
        "Dame Percila sera peinée de ma\n",
        "défaite, mais je suis certain que\f",
        "la beauté de ce combat l’aura ravie.\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, je vous engage à revenir\n",
        "au Castel de Combat aussi souvent qu’il\f",
        "vous plaira.\r",
        "Votre présence sera une grande joie et\n",
        "un immense honneur pour nous!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "BattleCastleScene_Text_BeatDarachGold",
      "en_US": [
        "Darach: I am humbled...\r",
        "What I’d perceived to be a weakness\n",
        "was only illusory...\r",
        "Or, perhaps you corrected it in the\n",
        "course of our battle.\r",
        "Regardless, your performance was\n",
        "stunning again.\r",
        "Though she cannot say it, Lady Caitlin\n",
        "appears quite taken by your style.\r",
        "For her sake at the very least, please\n",
        "do return to our Battle Castle!\r"
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Parsley: L’audace dont j’ai fait\n",
        "preuve était donc bien déplacée...\r",
        "Moi qui pensais avoir identifié\n",
        "votre faiblesse, me voilà fort marri...\r",
        "Peut-être avez-vous su la corriger\n",
        "lorsque que je tâchais de l’exploiter.\r",
        "Quoi qu’il en soit, votre victoire\n",
        "est éclatante, une fois encore.\r",
        "Dame Percila se joint à moi pour\n",
        "saluer vos qualités de Dresseur.\r",
        "Je vous assure que nous serons tous\n",
        "deux honorés de vous compter à nouveau\f",
        "parmi les visiteurs du Castel de Combat!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}